{/*
  DIRECTION CONTRACT — construction page (route /)
  THESIS: A machine waking up. The site presents itself as firmware mid-boot: honest about being unfinished, confident about what is coming.
  OWN-WORLD: Devkit console aesthetic — rails, calibration ticks, boot log. Not a generic "coming soon"; a bench instrument that belongs to an engineer.
  STORY: The visitor interrupts a boot sequence. The system self-reports, calibrates, and delivers one verdict: "El mundo aún no está listo para esto." The only action offered is entering the finished portfolio.
  FIRST VIEWPORT: Boot log, oversized verdict, and the "Abrir portafolio" link are all visible without scrolling on any viewport.
  FORM: Full-viewport grid with asymmetric rails. Deep indigo/graphite ground, ice-white type, acid chartreuse for system states, hot coral for warnings. One staged boot motion, removed under prefers-reduced-motion.
*/}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es-MX">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d1022" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Sitio en construcción. El portafolio de Juan Antonio Ruiz Zavala está disponible mientras el resto del sistema termina de arrancar."
    />
    <meta name="author" content="Juan Antonio Ruiz Zavala" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/portafolio/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <title>En construcción — Juan Antonio Ruiz Zavala</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --indigo: #0d1022;
        --graphite: #171b2e;
        --rail: #262c45;
        --chartreuse: #c8f542;
        --coral: #ff5d4d;
        --ice: #eef3f7;
        --ice-dim: #9aa6c0;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        min-height: 100svh;
        background: var(--indigo);
        color: var(--ice);
        font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Mono", "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr 4.5rem;
        grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
      }

      :focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid var(--chartreuse);
        outline-offset: 4px;
      }

      .skip-link {
        position: absolute;
        left: 0.5rem;
        top: -4rem;
        z-index: 10;
        background: var(--chartreuse);
        color: var(--indigo);
        font-weight: 700;
        padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: top 120ms ease-out;
      }

      .skip-link:focus-visible {
        top: 0.5rem;
      }

      /* ---- rails ---------------------------------------------------- */

      .rail {
        border-color: var(--rail);
        border-style: solid;
        color: var(--ice-dim);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }

      .rail-top {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        border-width: 0 0 1px;
        padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .rail-left {
        grid-column: 1;
        grid-row: 2;
        border-width: 0 1px 0 0;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 1.25rem 0;
      }

      .rail-right {
        grid-column: 3;
        grid-row: 2;
        border-width: 0 0 0 1px;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 1.25rem 0;
      }

      .rail-bottom {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        border-width: 1px 0 0;
        padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .rail-vertical {
        writing-mode: vertical-rl;
      }

      .status-dot {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 0.55rem;
        height: 0.55rem;
        margin-right: 0.45rem;
        vertical-align: baseline;
      }

      .status-dot-ok {
        background: var(--chartreuse);
      }

      .status-dot-warn {
        background: var(--coral);
      }

      .ticks {
        width: 1.4rem;
        height: 9rem;
        background: repeating-linear-gradient(
          to bottom,
          var(--rail) 0,
          var(--rail) 1px,
          transparent 1px,
          transparent 12px
        );
      }

      .ticks-short {
        height: 5rem;
      }

      /* ---- main stage ------------------------------------------------ */

      .stage {
        grid-column: 2;
        grid-row: 2;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: clamp(1.25rem, 3.5vh, 2.5rem);
        padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
        min-width: 0;
      }

      .boot-log {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
        color: var(--ice-dim);
        font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 1.6vw, 0.8rem);
        line-height: 1.9;
      }

      .boot-log strong {
        color: var(--chartreuse);
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .boot-log .warn {
        color: var(--coral);
      }

      .verdict {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: system-ui, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 8.5vw, 5.5rem);
        line-height: 1.02;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        max-width: 14ch;
      }

      .verdict .mark {
        color: var(--chartreuse);
      }

      .subline {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--ice-dim);
        font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 2vw, 0.95rem);
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 52ch;
      }

      .cta {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        align-self: flex-start;
        background: var(--chartreuse);
        color: var(--indigo);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2.2vw, 1.05rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 1rem 1.6rem;
        border: 2px solid var(--chartreuse);
      }

      .cta:hover,
      .cta:focus-visible {
        background: var(--indigo);
        color: var(--chartreuse);
      }

      .cta-arrow {
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      /* ---- calibration marks ------------------------------------------ */

      .calibration {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--ice-dim);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.22em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .calibration::before,
      .calibration::after {
        content: "";
        width: 1.1rem;
        height: 1.1rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--coral);
      }

      /* ---- boot motion ------------------------------------------------- */

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
        .boot-item {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(0.5rem);
          animation: boot-line 480ms ease-out forwards;
        }

        .boot-item:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 120ms; }
        .boot-item:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 420ms; }
        .boot-item:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 720ms; }

        .verdict {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(1.25rem);
          animation: boot-line 640ms ease-out 1050ms forwards;
        }

        .subline,
        .cta {
          opacity: 0;
          animation: boot-fade 520ms ease-out 1500ms forwards;
        }

        .status-dot-ok {
          animation: boot-blink 900ms steps(2, start) 120ms 2;
        }

        @keyframes boot-line {
          to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: none;
          }
        }

        @keyframes boot-fade {
          to {
            opacity: 1;
          }
        }

        @keyframes boot-blink {
          50% {
            opacity: 0.15;
          }
        }
      }

      /* ---- small viewports --------------------------------------------- */

      @media (max-width: 40rem) {
        body {
          grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
        }

        .rail-right {
          display: none;
        }

        .rail-left {
          grid-column: 1;
        }

        .stage {
          grid-column: 2;
          padding: 1.25rem;
        }

        .rail-top .rail-meta,
        .rail-bottom .rail-meta {
          display: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#contenido">Saltar al contenido</a>

    <header class="rail rail-top" aria-label="Estado del sistema">
      <span><span class="status-dot status-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>Núcleo en línea</span>
      <span class="rail-meta">DEVKIT/JARZ-01</span>
      <span class="rail-meta">REV 2026.07</span>
      <span><span class="status-dot status-dot-warn" aria-hidden="true"></span>Sitio en construcción</span>
    </header>

    <div class="rail rail-left" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="rail-vertical">Calibración de módulos</span>
      <span class="ticks"></span>
      <span class="rail-vertical">CH-01 / BUS-A</span>
    </div>

    <div class="rail rail-right" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="rail-vertical">0x0000: arranque</span>
      <span class="ticks ticks-short"></span>
      <span class="rail-vertical">0x2F00: portafolio</span>
    </div>

    <main id="contenido" class="stage">
      <ul class="boot-log">
        <li class="boot-item">[&nbsp;&nbsp;OK&nbsp;&nbsp;] <strong>Núcleo cargado</strong>: identidad verificada</li>
        <li class="boot-item">[&nbsp;&nbsp;OK&nbsp;&nbsp;] <strong>Módulo /portafolio operativo</strong>: compilado y servido</li>
        <li class="boot-item"><span class="warn">[ ESPERA ] Resto del sistema aún en ensamblaje…</span></li>
      </ul>

      <h1 class="verdict">El mundo aún no está listo para esto<span class="mark">.</span></h1>

      <p class="subline">
        La consola sigue arrancando. Mientras tanto, el módulo que sí terminó de cargar (el
        portafolio profesional) está disponible y en operación.
      </p>

      <a class="cta" href="/portafolio/">
        Abrir portafolio
        <span class="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>

      <p class="calibration">Marca de calibración: ejes alineados</p>
    </main>

    <footer class="rail rail-bottom" aria-label="Información de compilación">
      <span>Juan Antonio Ruiz Zavala</span>
      <span class="rail-meta">Salida estática: Astro</span>
      <span class="rail-meta">es-MX</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
